&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Spacely Sprockets:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Spacely Sprockets designs the motion systems inside autonomous delivery carts. Our carts share sidewalks with people, so every plan they make has to be safe, smooth and quick to compute.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a Motion Planning intern you will spend the summer on the planner that turns a map and a goal into a path. You will pair with a mentor, own a project end to end and present it to the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&amp;rsquo;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prototype planning and trajectory-optimization ideas in C++ and Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Evaluate them in simulation &amp;amp; on logged drives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write up results so others can build on them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&amp;rsquo;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Pursuing a BS, MS or PhD in computer science, robotics or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Coursework in planning, controls or optimization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Spacely Sprockets is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
